1
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,570
We have the same scent.

2
00:00:53,730 --> 00:00:54,760
I like this.

3
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:01,200
I don't want
to be friends with you anymore.

4
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,400
I want to date you.

5
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:13,630
Nothing will change.

6
00:01:14,289 --> 00:01:16,460
You'll live your life as usual.

7
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:19,220
Eat, sleep,

8
00:01:19,350 --> 00:01:21,370
and go to school
when you need to.

9
00:01:21,650 --> 00:01:23,789
Tell me when there's something funny.

10
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:26,460
Get angry when something bothers you.

11
00:01:26,590 --> 00:01:28,080
If you're angry,

12
00:01:28,220 --> 00:01:29,890
just tell me.

13
00:01:30,789 --> 00:01:32,000
But

14
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:35,300
be it summer or winter, stay with me.

15
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:39,820
Don't avoid me again.

16
00:01:43,050 --> 00:01:44,320
One week.

17
00:01:45,830 --> 00:01:47,009
One week?

18
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:49,660
Let's date for a week first.

19
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:54,470
I told you not to avoid me.

20
00:01:54,610 --> 00:01:56,810
Yet you found a way out.

21
00:01:57,370 --> 00:01:59,539
I mean... What if we find it better

22
00:01:59,690 --> 00:02:01,910
to be friends after starting to date?

23
00:02:02,450 --> 00:02:04,450
We've been friends for 19 years,

24
00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:06,680
so let's date for 19 years.

25
00:02:06,830 --> 00:02:09,560
If you think it isn't me,
let's talk about it then.

26
00:02:09,650 --> 00:02:11,070
But you can't do that now.

27
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,590
You have no choice.

28
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:16,650
Hey.

29
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,800
After dating for 19 years,

30
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,420
we'll be middle-aged uncles,

31
00:02:19,420 --> 00:02:20,450
you crazy dude.

32
00:02:26,570 --> 00:02:29,890
But in my eyes,
you'll always be pretty.

33
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:34,360
Where did you learn
to say things like that?

34
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,610
I learned it for this day. Why?

35
00:02:42,730 --> 00:02:44,850
Stop it. It's ticklish.

36
00:02:48,110 --> 00:02:49,090
It's ticklish?

37
00:02:59,970 --> 00:03:01,600
I still find it difficult,

38
00:03:01,770 --> 00:03:04,280
strange, and scary.

39
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:09,350
But as long as I'm with Cha Dohyun,

40
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:11,170
it seems like it'll be okay.

41
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,610
As for whether I call him

42
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:18,540
my friend or lover,

43
00:03:18,670 --> 00:03:20,310
it doesn't matter anymore.

44
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:25,260
As long as it's him.

45
00:03:50,890 --> 00:03:53,600
[Sung Inho]

46
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,200
[Kim Domin]

47
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:22,700
[Summertime]

48
00:04:25,750 --> 00:04:27,730
[D-119]

49
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:33,860
All right, let me see what your dream is.

50
00:04:36,990 --> 00:04:38,270
To be president?

51
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:45,630
You know what the president does, right?

52
00:04:45,940 --> 00:04:48,940
The president is someone
who can do anything he wants.

53
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:53,520
Do you know how long
the president's term is?

54
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:59,840
I want to be a president
for about 20 years.

55
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,570
Hey.

56
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:05,120
Do you think it's the president
of some random football club?

57
00:05:05,250 --> 00:05:09,120
I can go a rank lower.
How about a congressman?

58
00:05:09,250 --> 00:05:10,890
That sounds not bad.

59
00:05:11,230 --> 00:05:13,510
Do you think anyone
can be a congressman?

60
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:16,180
Well, as long as you have a loud voice,

61
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:18,060
and good at lying, no?

62
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:20,810
Seriously?

63
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:24,460
I wonder what you'll do when you grow up.

64
00:05:24,770 --> 00:05:26,350
I want to make a lot of money.

65
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:27,970
That again.

66
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:31,750
Gunwoo...

67
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,260
I want to be a landlord.

68
00:05:34,970 --> 00:05:37,890
I want to have 7 floors in Gangnam.

69
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:40,980
Why not 10 floors?

70
00:05:41,110 --> 00:05:43,300
10 floors...

71
00:05:43,770 --> 00:05:45,490
is a little too much.

72
00:05:45,670 --> 00:05:47,310
Is there any difference?

73
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,620
Fine.

74
00:05:48,860 --> 00:05:50,310
I want to be a rapper.

75
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,540
Are you cussing out at me now?

76
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:54,120
No.

77
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,610
Don't you know what gesture this is?

78
00:05:55,610 --> 00:05:56,270
No, I don't.

79
00:05:56,330 --> 00:05:57,150
Rappers do.

80
00:05:57,500 --> 00:05:59,690
Okay, be careful with it in the future.

81
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,310
What about you, Yihyun?

82
00:06:07,180 --> 00:06:09,640
I'm happy doing anything
but being a pastor.

83
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,290
Okay.

84
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:21,110
Okay, Yeo Eunho...

85
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,700
What?

86
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:28,160
You're okay with doing anything too?

87
00:06:31,550 --> 00:06:34,730
I don't know what to choose.

88
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:38,880
You must have dreams.

89
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:43,550
I don't know.

90
00:06:45,409 --> 00:06:47,190
Is there nothing you want to do?

91
00:06:48,070 --> 00:06:49,409
No.

92
00:06:51,470 --> 00:06:54,170
Don't you have anything you like?

93
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:55,630
Come in!

94
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:03,370
Here are the documents you asked for.

95
00:07:03,510 --> 00:07:05,070
Okay, thank you.

96
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:14,570
Go ahead.

97
00:07:20,650 --> 00:07:22,210
Well...

98
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,540
I heard you two grew up together.

99
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:28,770
Yes.

100
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,860
How long do you think
this friendship will last?

101
00:07:34,170 --> 00:07:35,980
Going to different universities,

102
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:38,909
doing different jobs—
you'll have to grow up one day.

103
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,240
By then,

104
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,970
no matter it's friendship or not,

105
00:07:41,970 --> 00:07:44,550
there will be different social circles
you hang out with.

106
00:07:44,550 --> 00:07:47,150
Childhood friendship is useless.

107
00:07:47,430 --> 00:07:52,909
So think about who you're friends with

108
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:57,340
and discuss with your parents
which university you want to enroll in.

109
00:07:57,610 --> 00:07:58,630
Got it?

110
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,700
Okay.

111
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:10,800
[Cha Dohyun: good at studying,
student council president, handsome]

112
00:08:11,010 --> 00:08:13,350
[Me: bad at studying, a proud
member of the school, handsome and cute]

113
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:21,920
[Cha Dohyun: can get into a good school]
[Me: can work at my parents']

114
00:08:22,930 --> 00:08:27,320
[Cha Dohyun: can find a good job]

115
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:35,960
[Cha Dohyun: can find a good job]
[Me: ??]

116
00:08:38,090 --> 00:08:41,720
And then? What about dating?

117
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:46,170
[Dating? Marriage?]

118
00:08:43,450 --> 00:08:44,990
What about marriage?

119
00:08:47,850 --> 00:08:50,720
What would we be like then?

120
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,490
In 10 years,

121
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,600
will we still be childhood friends,

122
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,980
old friends,

123
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:03,890
[Will we be childhood friends,
old friends or lovers?]

124
00:09:01,910 --> 00:09:03,410
or lovers?

125
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:24,350
You said you had no friends
other than me. Nonsense.

126
00:09:40,670 --> 00:09:41,570
Are you crazy?

127
00:09:44,490 --> 00:09:46,230
What if someone sees us?

128
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,710
So what?

129
00:09:54,580 --> 00:09:56,380
Speaking of, where's everyone?

130
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,730
What's going on?

131
00:09:58,820 --> 00:10:00,650
They went for lunch without me?

132
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:02,490
I asked them to go.

133
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:05,530
I can do that with my current identity.

134
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:07,780
What identity?

135
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:15,740
Let's go to the snack shop.

136
00:10:16,730 --> 00:10:17,780
I'm hungry.

137
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:20,690
Okay.

138
00:10:20,950 --> 00:10:21,790
By the way,

139
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:25,240
don't you have anything to do
for the student council today?

140
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:29,150
I was fired.

141
00:10:29,570 --> 00:10:30,640
What?

142
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,270
No.

143
00:10:32,530 --> 00:10:34,930
To be exact, I quit.

144
00:10:35,530 --> 00:10:36,610
Why?

145
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:40,140
Because it's hard
to focus on studying and dating

146
00:10:40,270 --> 00:10:42,020
while being the student council president,

147
00:10:42,020 --> 00:10:43,750
so I quit.

148
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:44,950
Are you crazy?

149
00:10:45,090 --> 00:10:47,890
What about plus points
for college applications?

150
00:10:50,070 --> 00:10:53,200
The term of the student council president
is a semester.

151
00:10:53,290 --> 00:10:54,940
When my term was up last week,

152
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:56,780
I handed it over.

153
00:10:59,670 --> 00:11:00,770
Is that so?

154
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:11,590
Didn't you say we were going
to the snack shop?

155
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:18,540
[Teacher's Toilet]

156
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:21,020
Why are we here?

157
00:11:22,810 --> 00:11:23,610
Hey!

158
00:11:25,470 --> 00:11:26,580
[Occupied]

159
00:11:26,310 --> 00:11:28,880
Are you crazy? We're in school.

160
00:12:30,070 --> 00:12:31,410
You pervert!

161
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:37,020
Let me go!

162
00:12:38,110 --> 00:12:40,970
Do you want the whole school
to know that you kissed?

163
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:54,010
Wait for me at the gate
after the festival.

164
00:13:02,750 --> 00:13:03,770
Yeo Eunho.

165
00:13:08,190 --> 00:13:10,150
Hey, I said we'd meet at the gate.

166
00:13:10,430 --> 00:13:12,190
Why did you come out from here instead?

167
00:13:12,190 --> 00:13:13,270
Stay back.

168
00:13:13,570 --> 00:13:14,600
Go away.

169
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:16,170
Let's go home together.

170
00:13:16,950 --> 00:13:18,030
No!

171
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:28,810
[Cha Dohyun]

172
00:13:29,210 --> 00:13:31,350
What? He's still up?

173
00:13:33,930 --> 00:13:35,070
Hello?

174
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:41,580
Are you upset?
Why aren't you saying anything?

175
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:44,230
Yeo Eunho, what are you doing?

176
00:13:46,170 --> 00:13:47,620
Playing games.

177
00:13:48,290 --> 00:13:49,490
Where?

178
00:13:50,660 --> 00:13:51,930
On the bed.

179
00:13:52,380 --> 00:13:53,710
What are you eating?

180
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,790
Short sleeves and undies.

181
00:13:56,610 --> 00:13:58,630
My mom told me to save electricity
and not turn on the air conditioner.

182
00:13:58,630 --> 00:14:00,270
It's so hot.

183
00:14:03,740 --> 00:14:06,880
Are you angry because I ran away?

184
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:09,130
Actually, I let you go on purpose.

185
00:14:09,130 --> 00:14:10,660
Then why are you calling me?

186
00:14:11,530 --> 00:14:13,030
What game are you playing?

187
00:14:14,530 --> 00:14:16,480
A racing game.

188
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:20,050
Darn it. Why did he throw that out
at the beginning?

189
00:14:20,370 --> 00:14:21,480
Yeo Eunho.

190
00:14:22,770 --> 00:14:24,360
Call my name.

191
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:27,910
Cha Dohyun.

192
00:14:28,740 --> 00:14:30,210
One more time.

193
00:14:31,780 --> 00:14:33,350
Cha Dohyun!

194
00:14:39,430 --> 00:14:40,550
Hey!

195
00:14:41,140 --> 00:14:42,260
Yeah?

196
00:14:42,810 --> 00:14:44,050
What are you doing?

197
00:14:44,330 --> 00:14:47,490
Thinking about you
listening to your voice.

198
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,750
So, while thinking about me

199
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:51,660
listening to my voice,
what are you doing?

200
00:14:51,660 --> 00:14:52,960
Yeo Eunho.

201
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:55,450
Do you want to come to my house now?

202
00:14:55,450 --> 00:14:57,370
You darn pervert. I'm hanging up.

203
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,670
If you don't come, I'll go to you.

204
00:15:02,940 --> 00:15:04,710
See you in the central park.

205
00:15:10,660 --> 00:15:12,370
What took you so long?

206
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,360
Thank you.

207
00:15:24,730 --> 00:15:25,620
Hey.

208
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:28,900
Are you moving out for college?

209
00:15:31,230 --> 00:15:32,970
Do you want me to do that?

210
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,950
Why are you asking me?

211
00:15:37,310 --> 00:15:40,310
I'm asking if you want me
to move out after graduation.

212
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:41,470
I mean...

213
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:45,890
I'm just thinking if the school is far
it'd be tiring to commute.

214
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:48,330
Jihyun doesn't come home often anyway.

215
00:15:48,900 --> 00:15:50,950
There's no need to stay there.

216
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:53,450
Is there a place you want to stay?

217
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,290
What?

218
00:15:55,650 --> 00:15:58,100
It's convenient to stay near school,

219
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:00,770
but it's probably noisy around there too.

220
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:02,490
Why are you asking me?

221
00:16:02,810 --> 00:16:04,540
If you don't really care,

222
00:16:04,740 --> 00:16:06,590
I'll just decide.

223
00:16:06,810 --> 00:16:08,830
What does that have to do with me?

224
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:21,620
After all, we're staying together.

225
00:16:21,780 --> 00:16:23,640
I can't decide on my own.

226
00:16:23,770 --> 00:16:25,340
I'm staying with you?

227
00:16:26,690 --> 00:16:29,000
Do you want to live here alone then?

228
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:33,340
If there's somewhere you want to stay,
let me know.

229
00:16:33,710 --> 00:16:37,740
I'll apply for a university near there.

230
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:38,940
Hey!

231
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:41,660
What are you talking about?

232
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,680
I'm just going to work odd jobs
in our neighborhood,

233
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:46,920
or go to the army early.

234
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:48,520
I was thinking if you moved out,

235
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:50,750
I'd go hang out with you
from time to time.

236
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:52,480
Why should I stay at your place?

237
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:54,600
If I don't live here,

238
00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:56,910
how will this be our neighborhood?

239
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:15,190
Whether it's doing part-time jobs
or retaking the college entrance exams,

240
00:17:15,190 --> 00:17:16,690
stay at my place.

241
00:17:19,730 --> 00:17:21,380
Even if you refuse,

242
00:17:21,530 --> 00:17:23,190
nothing will change in the end.

243
00:17:23,190 --> 00:17:24,680
So just accept it.

244
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:33,600
How can I live alone

245
00:17:33,740 --> 00:17:35,450
without you?

246
00:17:41,910 --> 00:17:43,630
You're so annoying.

247
00:17:49,230 --> 00:17:52,430
Saying you're going to apply
for a college around here...

248
00:17:55,110 --> 00:17:56,020
Are you trying to say

249
00:17:56,020 --> 00:17:58,080
you can get into any college you want?

250
00:17:58,810 --> 00:18:00,530
Why ask the obvious?

251
00:18:21,290 --> 00:18:24,420
Hey, why do you have this?

252
00:18:24,550 --> 00:18:27,130
You threw it at me while running.

253
00:18:27,260 --> 00:18:28,660
Wasn't it for me to see?

254
00:18:29,700 --> 00:18:32,000
[Cha Dohyun: good at studying, student council president,
handsome, can get into a good school, can find a good job]

255
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,800
[Me: bad at studying, a proud member of the school,
handsome and cute, can work at my parents, live with Cha Dohyun]

256
00:18:33,800 --> 00:18:35,880
[Childhood friends? Old friends? Lovers?]
[All of the above]

257
00:18:47,850 --> 00:18:50,960
Don't worry, Eunho.

258
00:19:06,630 --> 00:19:07,910
Kids,

259
00:19:08,350 --> 00:19:11,020
the college entrance exam
is coming real soon.

260
00:19:13,540 --> 00:19:15,680
Yes, I'm worried too.

261
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:20,050
Don't think you can fool around
during the vacation, okay?

262
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:21,510
Yes.

263
00:19:22,040 --> 00:19:24,090
Who's on duty today?

264
00:19:25,690 --> 00:19:28,190
Okay. Lock the windows and doors
before leaving.

265
00:19:28,190 --> 00:19:31,470
That's it for this semester's
last weekly meeting.

266
00:19:31,710 --> 00:19:32,880
Bye-bye!

267
00:19:38,970 --> 00:19:41,320
Hey! Internet cafe?

268
00:19:41,470 --> 00:19:42,500
Of course.

269
00:19:42,630 --> 00:19:43,710
You guys are going too, right?

270
00:19:43,710 --> 00:19:44,640
Yeah.

271
00:19:45,470 --> 00:19:46,470
What about you?

272
00:19:48,290 --> 00:19:50,220
My mom asked me to help at the store.

273
00:19:50,320 --> 00:19:51,430
I have to go there early.

274
00:19:51,430 --> 00:19:52,970
Come to see us when it's closed.

275
00:19:52,970 --> 00:19:54,700
We'll stay up all night anyway.

276
00:19:55,070 --> 00:19:56,310
Okay.

277
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:59,250
Is Sungho buying dinner tonight?

278
00:19:59,250 --> 00:20:00,050
What are you talking about?

279
00:20:00,050 --> 00:20:01,000
Nice!

280
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:09,870
You're here.

281
00:20:17,180 --> 00:20:19,540
What? Why are you giving me this?

282
00:20:19,820 --> 00:20:21,870
Today is our 7th day together.

283
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:26,010
You're right.

284
00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:29,140
You said we'd date for 7 days—

285
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:31,780
saying we might be better off as friends.

286
00:20:34,010 --> 00:20:35,100
So?

287
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:40,640
Do you know what yellow roses symbolize?

288
00:20:40,730 --> 00:20:42,440
How would I know?

289
00:20:43,700 --> 00:20:45,360
Friendship

290
00:20:46,110 --> 00:20:47,440
and eternal love.

291
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:51,910
One flower has these two meanings.

292
00:20:52,450 --> 00:20:55,380
It probably means these two identities
are similar.

293
00:21:09,170 --> 00:21:10,300
Yeo Eunho.

294
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:12,160
Yeo Eunho, what's wrong?

295
00:21:16,060 --> 00:21:17,720
You don't like these flowers?

296
00:21:20,450 --> 00:21:22,780
Will you hold hands and kiss your friends?

297
00:21:25,010 --> 00:21:26,900
I won't do that, you lunatic.

298
00:21:28,940 --> 00:21:31,940
And I can't stand having friends
like that around you.

299
00:21:32,020 --> 00:21:34,220
If you do, cut it off as soon as possible.

300
00:21:42,940 --> 00:21:43,960
Also,

301
00:21:45,490 --> 00:21:47,690
how can friendship and love be the same?

302
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:51,100
You fool.

303
00:22:26,250 --> 00:22:32,330
[Summertime]

304
00:22:32,410 --> 00:22:36,330
Hello, 20-year-old Yeo Eunho.

305
00:22:36,590 --> 00:22:37,950
We're 20 now.

306
00:22:38,240 --> 00:22:41,880
-A man's life... starts now!
-Starts now!

307
00:22:45,450 --> 00:22:46,920
Damn you, Cha Dohyun!

308
00:22:49,460 --> 00:22:51,530
I hope I never fight with Yeo Eunho,

309
00:22:52,090 --> 00:22:54,320
and we stay happy forever.

310
00:22:55,920 --> 00:22:58,770
How many times have I told you
to make a wish in your heart? Silly.

311
00:22:58,770 --> 00:23:00,720
It won't come true if you say it out.

312
00:23:01,280 --> 00:23:02,980
My wish

313
00:23:03,870 --> 00:23:05,190
will come true.

314
00:23:10,630 --> 00:23:11,760
Where's Cha Dohyun?

315
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:15,840
We broke up.
